sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Browser
  participant API as Spring Security / Auth API
  participant Auth as Authentication service
  participant DB as User database
  User->>Browser: Submit username and password
  Browser->>API: POST /api/auth/login
  API->>Auth: Validate credentials and role state
  Auth->>DB: Find normalized account and credential state
  DB-->>Auth: Account / role / MFA state
  Auth-->>API: Authentication result
  alt Credentials valid and MFA not required
    API-->>Browser: Set HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite cookie
    Browser->>API: Request protected page/API with cookie
    API->>Auth: Validate cookie and required authority
    Auth-->>API: Subject and authorities
    API-->>Browser: Authorized response
  else MFA challenge required
    API-->>Browser: OTP challenge; no authenticated session yet
    User->>Browser: Submit authenticator code
    Browser->>API: Verify OTP
    API->>Auth: Verify TOTP and issue session on success
    Auth-->>API: Verification result
    API-->>Browser: Authenticated cookie or explicit error
  else Invalid or disabled account
    API-->>Browser: Reject; no authenticated cookie
  end
